* DRV8837 single H-bridge, behavioral switch model (spice.source: behavioral), written for this project.
* Ports in symbol pin order: VM OUT1 OUT2 GND IN2 IN1 nSLEEP VCC.
* Truth table (TI DRV8837 datasheet, nSLEEP = 1): IN1 IN2 = 0 0 coast (Z Z), 0 1 reverse (L H),
* 1 0 forward (H L), 1 1 brake (L L). nSLEEP = 0 or VCC under UVLO: all outputs Z.
* RHS, RLS: 0.325 ohm each = 0.65 ohm HS + LS (notes/parts.md, JSM/MSKSEMI page, VM 3.3 V).
* Sleep currents 45 nA (VM) and 17 nA (VCC) from the MSKSEMI page (notes/parts.md).
* IQVM_ON and IQVCC_ON (awake, not switching) are ESTIMATES (TI datasheet not read): 0.5 mA and 0.3 mA.
* Input pull-downs 100 k (IN1, IN2) and 500 k (nSLEEP) are typical DRV883x values (estimate).
* Body diodes from each output to VM and GND clamp the coil when the bridge goes to Z.
.subckt DRV8837_BEH vm out1 out2 gnd in2 in1 nslp vcc params: RHS=0.325 RLS=0.325 VTH=1.2 VCCUV=1.6
+ IQVM_SLP=45n IQVCC_SLP=17n IQVM_ON=0.5m IQVCC_ON=0.3m RPD=100k RPDS=500k GOFF=1n
Rpd1 in1 gnd {RPD}
Rpd2 in2 gnd {RPD}
Rpds nslp gnd {RPDS}
Ben ena gnd V = 1/(1+exp(-(v(nslp,gnd)-{VTH})*40)) / (1+exp(-(v(vcc,gnd)-{VCCUV})*40))
Ba1 a1 gnd V = 1/(1+exp(-(v(in1,gnd)-{VTH})*40))
Ba2 a2 gnd V = 1/(1+exp(-(v(in2,gnd)-{VTH})*40))
B1h vm out1 I = (v(ena)*v(a1)*(1-v(a2))/{RHS} + {GOFF}) * v(vm,out1)
B1l out1 gnd I = (v(ena)*v(a2)/{RLS} + {GOFF}) * v(out1,gnd)
B2h vm out2 I = (v(ena)*v(a2)*(1-v(a1))/{RHS} + {GOFF}) * v(vm,out2)
B2l out2 gnd I = (v(ena)*v(a1)/{RLS} + {GOFF}) * v(out2,gnd)
D1h out1 vm DBODY
D1l gnd out1 DBODY
D2h out2 vm DBODY
D2l gnd out2 DBODY
Bqvm vm gnd I = ({IQVM_SLP} + v(ena)*{IQVM_ON}) * min(1, max(0, v(vm,gnd)/1.8))
Bqvcc vcc gnd I = ({IQVCC_SLP} + v(ena)*{IQVCC_ON}) * min(1, max(0, v(vcc,gnd)/1.8))
.model DBODY D(IS=1e-12 N=1.2 RS=0.1)
.ends DRV8837_BEH
